    "preferences": "Optimise for the chance of a valid paid finding, not headline payout: small and mid-size programs, newly launched programs, recently added scope, stale or missing audits, mediums/lows paid without PoC, Vault-backed rewards. Headline bounties above $1M are crowded and should score lower unless the scope has a Go client or bridge component where the researcher's experience is rare. Preferred scope: Go-based clients, bridges and cross-chain messaging, stablecoin/payment-style value flows, lending accounting. KYC is acceptable; pay-to-submit is a strong negative.",
